PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_Intro::
	.string "Ah! I heard about you, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "I lead the REVIEW BOARD.\p"
	.string "You can call me SANGUINE the\n"
	.string "EMERGENT USER.\p"
	.string "You know that EMERGENT DAEMON\n"
	.string "are mythical.\p"
	.string "They're hard to bind and raise,\n"
	.string "but their powers are superior.\p"
	.string "I never know what they'll do.\n"
	.string "That's the best part!\p"
	.string "Your LEAGUE challenge ends with\n"
	.string "me, {PLAYER}! Surprise me!{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

PokemonLeague_LancesRoom_Text_RematchIntro::
